 that bryce  dallas howard had been cast as sue storm  slash the invisible woman now keep in  mind bryce has many connections with  disney her father ron howard is a  massive part of star wars she herself  directed episodes of the mandalorian and  probably one of the best episodes of the  book of boba fett so she's already  worked with disney plus not to mention  her co-star for the jurassic world  movies is chris pratt so i'm sure  there's a lot going for her with disney  disney seems to love her if they invited  her to direct a book of boba fett  episode after the two mandalorian  episodes that she directed and other  people who are majorly involved with  disney love her but as you can see in  this video she is denying that she is  not playing the invisible woman in the  upcoming fantastic four movie in the mcu  now there's two parts to this one is  that i actually think she would do a  great job as sue storm i know a lot of  people are saying that she needs to lose  weight for the role but actors and  actresses do that all the time for roles  and honestly she'd be fine the way she  is but the second thing is that i  actually wouldn't mind if she is not the  invisible woman because i would really  love for emily blunt to play the  invisible woman i just think the idea of  having a husband and wife in real life  john krasinski and emily blunt playing a  husband and wife in the movie reed  richards and sue storm would be really  cool i also think that emily blunt  really really fits the role as sue storm  i mean all of the fan art of john  krasinski looked fantastic and then when  we saw him on screen he looked fantastic  pun intended and i'm sure it's going to  be exactly the same for his wife emily  blunt we've all seen the fan art of her  she looks again fantastic as a member of  the fantastic four and here's the deal  they have at least talked to emily blunt  about this there's zero chance that they  haven't talked to her about this because  i mean her husband w